findutils — GNU find and xargs commands

This r10 candidate rebuilds the reviewed Buildroot 2025.02.1 recipe with the
baseline SELinux option disabled. The package contains private executables and
/usr/bin/tdvp-find plus /usr/bin/tdvp-xargs frontends; K230 BusyBox already
owns the standard names. It neither replaces firmware files nor introduces a
new shared runtime provider.
